    "text": {
     "en": "An equation says two expressions are equal. To solve it, do the same thing to both sides to keep it balanced.\nx plus 3 equals 10. Subtract 3 from both sides to get x equals 7.\nWe check by putting the answer back: 7 plus 3 is 10."
    }
